{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"browser-sandbox-integration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Browser sandbox integration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The unpublished SDK integration is preserved here as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".disabled"},{"type":"text","value":" source files. It is excluded from compilation and package installation. Re-enable these files only after the SDK and runtime have a reproducible published release or source dependency, then restore the Vite setup and runtime tests."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Existing TanStack.com example previews retain their current implementation. TanChat workspace preview controls are disabled for this alpha."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"browser-sandbox-integration","text":"Browser sandbox integration","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"# Browser sandbox integration\n\nThe unpublished SDK integration is preserved here as `.disabled` source files. It is excluded from compilation and package installation. Re-enable these files only after the SDK and runtime have a reproducible published release or source dependency, then restore the Vite setup and runtime tests.\n\nExisting TanStack.com example previews retain their current implementation. TanChat workspace preview controls are disabled for this alpha.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"# Browser sandbox integration\n\nThe unpublished SDK integration is preserved here as `.disabled` source files. It is excluded from compilation and package installation. Re-enable these files only after the SDK and runtime have a reproducible published release or source dependency, then restore the Vite setup and runtime tests.\n\nExisting TanStack.com example previews retain their current implementation. TanChat workspace preview controls are disabled for this alpha.\n"}
